ServerDir: CServerDir_Titan::LoadDirServerList returns when there is no
sierraup.cfg, as the 1.3 ServerDir.dll does (the SDK's code passed the null
FILE to fgets, which crashed on opening the Internet multiplayer screens:
the game directory has no sierraup.cfg, the Sierra updater's file).

Applied by tools/jupitersrc.py after serverdir.patch.

--- a/Game/Libs/ServerDir/CServerDir_Titan.cpp
+++ b/Game/Libs/ServerDir/CServerDir_Titan.cpp
@@ -1657,6 +1657,10 @@
 
 	// Read the directory servers out of the SierraUp.cfg file
 	pFile = fopen("sierraup.cfg", "r");
+	// nolf2src: 1.3 returns when there is no sierraup.cfg (retail
+	// 0x1000c1c6); the SDK's code read from a null FILE
+	if (!pFile)
+		return;
 
 	while(fgets(szBuffer, sizeof(szBuffer), pFile))
 	{
